# 🚀 FairCheck AI

An AI-powered web application to detect bias in automated decision-making systems (like hiring or loan approval).

## 🧠 Features

- 📊 Predict candidate selection using ML model
- ⚖️ Detect bias (e.g., gender-based unfairness)
- 📈 Dashboard with selection statistics
- 🤖 AI suggestions to reduce bias (Gemini API)
- 🔥 Full-stack app (React + FastAPI)

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Frontend

- React (Vite)
- Axios
- Tailwind CSS

### Backend

- FastAPI
- Python

### Machine Learning

- scikit-learn
- pandas
- numpy

### Optional

- Firebase (for database)
- Gemini API (AI suggestions)

---

