---

## ⚙️ Setup Instructions

### 🔹 1. Clone repo

```
git clone https://github.com/Kritika011/faircheckai.git
cd faircheck-ai
```

---

### 🔹 2. Backend Setup

```
cd backend
python -m venv .venv
.venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Run server:

```
python -m uvicorn backend.main:app --reload
```

---

### 🔹 3. Frontend Setup

```
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```

---

## 🌐 API Endpoint

POST `/predict`

Example:

```
{
  "gender": "F",
  "experience": 3,
  "score": 75
}
```

---

## 🎯 Goal

To build a fair and transparent AI system that:

- Detects bias
- Explains decisions
- Suggests improvements

